@startuml "Memento - GUI - Class Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title A GUI component that saves its state in a memento
class GuiComponent <<Originator>> {
  - x, y, length, width
  + moveTo(x, y)
  + resize(length, width)
  + createMemento() : Memento
  + restore(Memento)
}
class "GuiComponent.Memento" as Memento <<Memento>> {
  - state : GuiComponentState
  - Memento(GuiComponentState)
}
class GuiComponentState <<record>> {
  x, y, length, width
}
class Main <<Caretaker>>
Main --> Memento : keeps
Main --> GuiComponent
GuiComponent ..> Memento : creates, reads
Memento --> GuiComponentState
note bottom of Memento
  Nested in GuiComponent: only the
  window can make one or read it.
end note
@enduml
